 "sentences": [
  "There was a spring of light at the foot of a hill.",
  "A clay jar stood empty beside it.",
  "A boat-shaped hollow lay open in the rock.",
  "Ada wanted to send a boat to the moon.",
  "She pushed the hollow hard, but it did not move.",
  "She wondered what the jar did.",
  "She dipped the jar into the spring, and it began to glow.",
  "She was delighted with the jar.",
  "She touched the hollow, and it began to glow.",
  "A small skiff took shape in the hollow.",
  "Ada wondered what the hollow needed.",
  "She pressed on the hollow again, but it would not move.",
  "She gave the hollow a hard push, but it did not budge.",
  "She grew frustrated with the hollow.",
  "She touched the skiff, but nothing happened.",
  "She shoved the hollow, but it did not move.",
  "She dipped the jar into the spring, and it brimmed with light.",
  "She pushed the skiff hard, and it climbed past the clouds and landed on the moon.",
  "The jar went dark.",
  "The hollow lay empty again.",
  "Ada laughed with joy."
 ],
